    "turn_text": "Fantastic. Well, you know, I just want to make sure we cover this because so much of our audience is interested in real estate investing. You know, one of the things you talk about is Dodd-Frank. And this is this onerous piece of legislation, about 2,200 pages long, that has wide-ranging impact on the real estate in business, whether it be investing or for homeowners or trading notes and mortgage instruments on the secondary market. What do you think? I mean, Trump has specifically addressed Dodd-Frank. I know. What do you think will happen to Dodd-Frank under Trump administration?",
