    "turn_idx": 29,
    "turn_text": "that's what I mean is if you're gonna have a true private market then people make these more you just have to have a little capital I mean, that's part of the deal. I mean, you can't have people in the business of making mortgages who have no capital to back their processes than you're just asking for trouble.",
